+          stream irregularly sampled where each sample contains the HPI data in the
+          format of a vector of shape (12,) containing the 4x4 transformation matrix::
+
+              R11 R12 R13 T1
+              R21 R22 R23 T2
+              R31 R32 R33 T3
+              0   0   0   1
+        """
+        self._check_connected("connect_hpi_stream()")
